[00:16.98]1. Because we are imperfect, O Jehovah,
[00:23.72]The inclination of our heart is flawed.
[00:31.28]There is a sin that easily ensnares us—
[00:38.30]A lack of faith in you, the living God.
[00:46.74](Chorus)
[00:46.74]Give us more faith, we beg of you, Jehovah.
[00:54.82]Please help us out according to our need.
[01:02.08]Give us more faith, according to your mercy,
[01:09.92]That we may honor you in word and deed.
[01:36.02]2. Apart from faith, no one can fully please you.
[01:42.40]We must believe our faith will be repaid.
[01:50.08]And as a shield, our faith provides a refuge.
[01:58.02]We face the future firm and unafraid.
[02:06.46](Chorus)
[02:06.46]Give us more faith, we beg of you, Jehovah.
[02:14.60]Please help us out according to our need.
[02:21.78]Give us more faith, according to your mercy,
[02:29.54]That we may honor you in word and deed.
